4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lF7XlFMMoqEQ7kNvwF47ZyK&_nc_oc=AdqP5TlHzzZJ8qRJOJOKgHYcH3f_Y1Ijmh007cBym5Ti4hbxuKwKpYTjtr4j1_bpWfw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5KzPdWD7wAzj8ECzrErBlTMTYVSSJ-SzihBudCZyNL8w&oe=6A1ED4D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qte9u8w9CFcQ7kNvwHVcbGr&_nc_oc=Adoqw93nQKKMp_9PiB7odpTJu2EW7wikbT80_5YhiuuKbHInwyDBcxynfIv83Ds0O30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7tWO0roUz9jELnvEXMecHDTc6SnudO5v2J0-yobh1nLg&oe=6A1ED9B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tt3ulXDcXbEQ7kNvwHfaa6q&_nc_oc=AdotuDoNeT_GkJDzXOHMv6SuZ64p3lC3TPh_TtXnfw7hGO95johsqo23V73bxpwoZLo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7FdpjNwqSqHeGoBhnW7SOM54onVCllg1Ij6SN16O6j1g&oe=6A1EE755"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p